WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.225
Welcome to the On-Chain Operator Program.

00:00:03.225 --> 00:00:04.520
I'm glad you're here.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.692
In the next minute, I'll show you exactly

00:00:06.692 --> 00:00:08.140
how to get the most from it.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.693
The program runs in six stages, and

00:00:11.693 --> 00:00:13.745
each one builds on the last.

00:00:13.745 --> 00:00:15.280
So do them in order.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.805
Stage 0 gets you set up safely.

00:00:17.805 --> 00:00:20.955
Stage 5 has you running your own on-chain bank.

00:00:20.955 --> 00:00:22.801
Everything in between is the path

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:23.995
from one to the other.

00:00:25.295 --> 00:00:27.270
Every lesson works the same way.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.590
Watch the video.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.985
It walks through the idea

00:00:29.985 --> 00:00:31.680
and the numbers on screen.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.535
Then do the checklist, for real,

00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:35.240
with a small test amount.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.206
Then check yourself with three quiz

00:00:37.206 --> 00:00:39.090
questions before you move on.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.095
The checklist is where the learning sticks.

00:00:42.395 --> 00:00:43.905
New to a topic?

00:00:43.905 --> 00:00:46.690
Every module opens with a Mastery Starter.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.026
It takes about ten minutes, and gets you

00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:51.020
from zero to ready for that module.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.208
Today, open Module 0, and

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.396
print the Day-1 Setup Kit.

00:00:56.396 --> 00:00:57.921
Work through it in order.

00:00:57.921 --> 00:00:59.469
Use only an amount you can

00:00:59.469 --> 00:01:01.546
afford to lose while you learn.

00:01:01.546 --> 00:01:02.511
There's no rush.

00:01:03.811 --> 00:01:05.456
And one rule, forever.

00:01:05.456 --> 00:01:07.316
Never share your seed phrase.

00:01:07.316 --> 00:01:09.638
Nobody from this program will ever ask

00:01:09.638 --> 00:01:11.426
for it, or for your keys.

00:01:11.426 --> 00:01:12.986
Anyone who does is a scammer.

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:15.326
That's it.

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:17.661
Open Module 0, and let's begin.
